- Teka. Ayun ang 96 Geumseong-ro.

47:25.425 --> 47:26.260
CCTV CONTROL ROOM

47:26.343 --> 47:27.427
MRS. OH

47:28.136 --> 47:29.263
Sandali.

47:31.139 --> 47:31.974
Hello, Mrs. Oh.

47:32.057 --> 47:34.643
